# Copied into the build output by adapter-cloudflare, which then appends its
# autogenerated /_app immutable rules (more specific, so they win over this
# catch-all). Edge-cache the prerendered HTML briefly with a generous SWR
# window; without this every HTML request revalidates (max-age=0).
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300, stale-while-revalidate=3600
